Tag name: cam6_4_211_ss.03
Originator(s): jtruesdal
Date: Oct 28, 2026
One-line Summary: HOMME update to E3SM b70b675a7b (split-form theta advection, tensor sponge layer)
Github PR URL: https://github.com/NCAR/StormSPEED/pull/99

Purpose of changes (include the issue number and title text for each relevant GitHub issue):
- Update the E3SM HOMME dycore (senh/dycore) from 057df66 to E3SM master b70b675a7b,
  bringing in Mark Taylor's split-form theta advection and the tensor sponge-layer
  Laplacian (E3SM PR #8642).
- Expose two new HOMME options:
  se_laplace_scaling (default 0): 0 keeps the constant-coefficient sponge (se_nu_top in
    m^2/s); > 0 selects the tensor sponge Laplacian, with se_nu_top in tensor-scaled units.
  se_tom_sponge_start (hPa, default 0): 0 keeps HOMME's standard sponge profile; > 0 sets
    the pressure where the top-of-model sponge begins (se_nu_top scaled by
    0.15*(se_tom_sponge_start/p)**2, zero below 0.15, capped at 8); applies to both sponges.

