Tag name: cam6_4_211_ss.02
Originator(s): jtruesdal
Date: <date>
One-line Summary: E3SM-dycore regression tests; hydrostatic restart fix; cam_shmem probe/fallback; tracer_data fix; SHM test
Github PR URL: <url>

Purpose of changes (include the issue number and title text for each relevant GitHub issue):
- Add regression tests for the E3SM HOMME dycores (CAM_TARGET=theta-l and
  theta-l_kokkos): debug runs with FPE traps (SMS_D), exact restart (ERS),
  PE-layout/thread/task-count reproducibility (ERP, PET, PEM), initial/hybrid/branch
  starts (ERI_D), nonhydrostatic and hydrostatic, physgrid ne3pg3, GLL ne3 (QPC6),
  analytic IC (FKESSLER ne16), ne16pg3 and ne30.  New categories:
    aux_cam_e3sm         gate: derecho intel (33 tests), derecho gnu (16), izumi gnu (12)
    aux_cam_e3sm_canary  derecho nvhpc theta-l smoke test (see #100, #101)
    aux_cam_e3sm_unify   tests for the planned src/dynamics/se unification
    aux_cam_e3sm_perf    PFS throughput (ne30)
    aux_cam_preqx        preqx (does not build yet, #104)
- Fix: theta-l hydrostatic restarts aborted ("cannot find W"): the restart reader
  always read W and PHINH, which hydrostatic runs do not write.  Skip them when
  theta_hydrostatic_mode and zero w_i/phinh_i, as E3SM does.
- Fix (#106): on izumi (Intel and NAG MVAPICH2) MPI_Win_shared_query returns size 0
  and no address to all non-leader ranks inside CESM, so cam_shmem_mod's node-shared
  tables (soil_erod, phys_prop, mo_jlong, tracer_data) were null on 23 of 24 ranks
  ("Reference to disassociated pointer" in soil_erod_mod).  init_comms now probes a
  small window collectively and, if any rank cannot see it, gives every rank private
  copies; answers are unchanged.  The atm log reports the probe result and the mode.
- New namelist switch cam_shmem_nl/cam_shmem_force_private (default .false.) forces
  private memory; used by the new SHM system test.
- tracer_data: from ESCOMP/CAM PR #1643 (commit 0b0bd236): the carry-forward of a
  time record also requires the same file name (PIO handles can be reused across
  files), and the node-shared source field is read on masterproc only and broadcast
  to the node leaders.
- New system test SHM (SystemTestsCompareTwo, one build): default cam_shmem settings
  vs cam_shmem_force_private = .true.; history must be BFB.
- Platforms removed from theta-l testing until their blockers are fixed:
  derecho nvhpc (#100 HOMME C++ does not build with nvc++; #101 not reproducible
  across MPI decompositions), izumi nag (#102 E3SM sort_mod.F90 declaration order),
  izumi intel (#103: stack overflow in large automatic arrays; fixed in ss.01 by
  -heap-arrays 64, to be re-added once verified).

