  geopotential, moist mixing ratio in cam/cam7/simple physpkg); physics_dme_adjust
  skipped for SENH (moist mass adjusted in HOMME, #92).
- Portability: no 16-byte reals with NVHPC (physconst NO_R16); Fortran conformance.
- Build/infrastructure: senh and Kokkos support (configure, build-namelist,
